WEBVTT

00:00:34.250 --> 00:00:35.530
Hoopa...

00:00:36.680 --> 00:00:39.750
Appear!

00:00:59.820 --> 00:01:02.550
Appear!

00:01:42.810 --> 00:01:44.650
Did Hoopa startle you?

00:01:45.150 --> 00:01:47.990
Hoopa can do anything!

00:02:27.210 --> 00:02:28.210
That's incredible.

00:02:28.830 --> 00:02:29.830
Whoa.

00:03:32.060 --> 00:03:33.060
What you think?

00:03:33.350 --> 00:03:34.630
Hoopa strong!

00:03:48.990 --> 00:03:49.990
Please stop!
Hoopa!

00:04:02.300 --> 00:04:03.430
What...

00:04:03.980 --> 00:04:04.980
you want?

00:04:15.610 --> 00:04:16.990
O imprisoning light...

00:04:17.660 --> 00:04:18.660
Come forth!

00:05:18.630 --> 00:05:22.040
Pocket Monsters, or "Pokémon" for short:

00:05:23.160 --> 00:05:26.220
The strange, mysterious
lifeforms on this planet.

00:05:31.660 --> 00:05:35.460
RAYQUAZA

00:05:35.850 --> 00:05:36.850
In the skies...

00:05:43.130 --> 00:05:45.970
ZEKROM

00:05:49.470 --> 00:05:52.310
RESHIRAM

00:05:53.830 --> 00:05:54.830
In the seas...

00:05:56.560 --> 00:05:59.400
KYOGRE

00:06:03.650 --> 00:06:06.490
LUGIA

00:06:07.940 --> 00:06:08.940
In the mountains...

00:06:11.530 --> 00:06:14.370
REGIGIGAS

00:06:20.080 --> 00:06:22.920
GIRATINA

00:06:27.680 --> 00:06:30.510
KYUREM

00:06:36.270 --> 00:06:39.100
GROUDON

00:06:40.180 --> 00:06:42.020
And even in the cities...

00:06:45.440 --> 00:06:48.280
LATIOS - LATIAS

00:06:48.600 --> 00:06:52.416
All around the world, wherever
you are, you can be sure to see them.

00:06:52.440 --> 00:06:54.910
DIALGA

00:06:59.040 --> 00:07:01.880
PALKIA

00:07:02.670 --> 00:07:04.750
There are as many dreams
as there are Pokémon.

00:07:05.530 --> 00:07:09.210
There are as many adventures
to be had as there are Pokémon.

00:07:39.910 --> 00:07:40.910
Solrock...

00:07:41.080 --> 00:07:42.080
Flash.

00:07:53.720 --> 00:07:54.720
O Time...
O Skies...

00:07:56.030 --> 00:07:57.530
O Vast creation...

00:07:58.410 --> 00:07:59.610
Carry my words...

00:08:00.310 --> 00:08:01.640
Open the olden knot!

00:08:02.350 --> 00:08:03.350
Begone!

00:08:08.410 --> 00:08:09.410
Ah!

00:08:59.590 --> 00:09:00.590
There you go!

00:09:02.170 --> 00:09:03.800
Hey, look!

00:09:04.010 --> 00:09:04.640
Huh?

00:09:04.940 --> 00:09:06.760
There are so many Pokémon!

00:09:17.350 --> 00:09:19.346
Harimaron, Yancham, you be careful.

00:09:19.370 --> 00:09:20.400
Ta-da!

00:09:20.870 --> 00:09:21.900
They're done!

00:09:24.810 --> 00:09:26.306
Today I have something special for you:

00:09:26.330 --> 00:09:27.880
Donut-shaped Pofflés.

00:09:29.850 --> 00:09:30.850
All right!

00:09:32.520 --> 00:09:36.280
Satoshi, who aims to become a Pokémon Master,
continues his journey together with his friends.

00:09:36.810 --> 00:09:41.070
Right now, they're taking a break
at a Pokémon Center in a desert.

00:09:44.550 --> 00:09:45.550
Yum!

00:09:45.790 --> 00:09:47.086
Delicious!

00:09:47.110 --> 00:09:48.220
They're nice, right?

00:09:48.670 --> 00:09:51.206
Don't you want to eat
more delicious donuts?

00:09:51.230 --> 00:09:52.410
Yeah, I do!

00:09:53.260 --> 00:09:54.890
Then once again, ta-da!

00:09:55.820 --> 00:09:57.380
This is Désser City, which is up ahead.

00:09:57.500 --> 00:09:58.900
It's famous for its donuts.

00:09:59.640 --> 00:10:00.790
Don't they look delicious?

00:10:01.080 --> 00:10:02.780
Eureka wants to try them!

00:10:03.430 --> 00:10:04.430
And that's not all.

00:10:04.790 --> 00:10:08.426
There's supposed to be a famous tourist attraction
related to a mythical Pokémon there, too!

00:10:08.450 --> 00:10:09.187
Wow...

00:10:09.211 --> 00:10:10.736
A mythical Pokémon, huh?

00:10:10.760 --> 00:10:12.080
Sounds interesting.

00:10:12.470 --> 00:10:14.140
Yeah! I can't wait!

00:10:15.400 --> 00:10:18.700
To get to Désser City, we
have to cross the desert, though.

00:10:19.050 --> 00:10:21.186
Once we get to the river,
a boat will take us there.

00:10:21.210 --> 00:10:23.290
A boat? What kind? What kind?

00:10:25.560 --> 00:10:27.270
Did Harimaron just use Flamethrower?

00:10:27.590 --> 00:10:29.180
That cannot be possible!

00:10:29.550 --> 00:10:30.550
What's going on?

00:10:38.120 --> 00:10:39.660
Harimaron, here is some water!

00:10:40.550 --> 00:10:42.090
It looks like it ate a Matoma Berry.

00:10:42.330 --> 00:10:43.370
The super duper spicy one?

00:10:43.830 --> 00:10:45.150
Maybe someone pulled a prank.

00:10:47.740 --> 00:10:48.740
Hold it!

00:10:58.630 --> 00:10:59.630
Appea-

00:11:03.980 --> 00:11:04.980
What is this place?

00:11:09.720 --> 00:11:10.720
Could we have...?

00:11:10.780 --> 00:11:11.780
Come from here?

00:11:21.830 --> 00:11:22.830
Did Hoopa startle you?

00:11:23.770 --> 00:11:24.770
You sure did!

00:11:25.900 --> 00:11:27.020
Who are you?

00:11:31.980 --> 00:11:32.980
Hoopa.

00:11:33.640 --> 00:11:34.640
"Hoopa"?

00:11:35.100 --> 00:11:36.100
You're a Pokémon?

00:11:39.550 --> 00:11:41.130
What is it, Pikachu?

00:11:56.150 --> 00:11:57.150
It's Désser City!

00:12:00.070 --> 00:12:01.070
Did this ring...?

00:12:02.780 --> 00:12:04.860
Hoopa never saw this before.

00:12:06.090 --> 00:12:07.230
It's called a Pikachu.

00:12:08.510 --> 00:12:09.210
Pikan!

00:12:09.530 --> 00:12:11.450
Not "Pikan", but "Pikachu".

00:12:12.830 --> 00:12:13.830
I'm Satoshi.

00:12:14.060 --> 00:12:15.060
Saton!
"Satoshi".

00:12:16.070 --> 00:12:17.070
Saton!

00:12:17.260 --> 00:12:18.470
Satoshi!

00:12:19.030 --> 00:12:23.886
Saton! Pikan! Saton! Pikan! Saton! Pikan!

00:12:23.910 --> 00:12:26.671
You sure are a strange one. Saton!
Pikan! Saton! Pikan! Saton! Pikan!

00:12:26.830 --> 00:12:28.010
You like Pikan?

00:12:28.700 --> 00:12:29.700
You mean Pikachu?

00:12:29.800 --> 00:12:30.970
Yeah, I like him a lot.

00:12:33.310 --> 00:12:34.310
Like a lot!

00:12:35.500 --> 00:12:37.950
Hoopa...

00:12:40.030 --> 00:12:41.550
Appear!

00:12:43.020 --> 00:12:44.020
Whoa!

00:12:45.310 --> 00:12:47.480
Hoopa! Hoopa! Hoopa! Hoopa!

00:12:56.170 --> 00:12:57.210
Hoopa! Hoopa!

00:12:59.740 --> 00:13:01.250
Saton startled?

00:13:07.670 --> 00:13:08.806
Saton! Saton!

00:13:08.830 --> 00:13:10.950
Which one Saton's Pikan?

00:13:11.320 --> 00:13:12.320
This one.

00:13:12.360 --> 00:13:13.360
Huh?

00:13:14.600 --> 00:13:15.720
How?

00:13:15.960 --> 00:13:18.430
Hoopa lost!

00:13:35.310 --> 00:13:36.310
What's this?

00:13:36.470 --> 00:13:37.470
Mary!

00:13:38.410 --> 00:13:39.410
Your Trainer?

00:13:39.660 --> 00:13:41.500
What's with all these Pikachu?

00:13:41.690 --> 00:13:43.830
Hoopa have them come!

00:13:44.090 --> 00:13:45.960
Don't you "Hoopa have them come" me!

00:13:46.230 --> 00:13:47.230
Send them back!

00:13:47.950 --> 00:13:49.450
Or no donut for you.

00:13:50.110 --> 00:13:51.530
Is that all right with you?

00:14:03.260 --> 00:14:04.810
Send them back!

00:14:21.000 --> 00:14:22.046
Oh my.
Awesome! Pikan awesome! Oh my.

00:14:22.070 --> 00:14:23.340
Awesome! Pikan awesome!

00:14:23.820 --> 00:14:25.000
Hoopa, now!

00:14:25.390 --> 00:14:26.460
Hoopa!

00:14:28.380 --> 00:14:29.720
Pikan, leave it to me!

00:14:29.990 --> 00:14:30.990
Hoopa!

00:14:36.890 --> 00:14:37.890
All right!

00:15:04.350 --> 00:15:05.960
Thanks, Pikachu.

00:15:07.580 --> 00:15:08.750
Thank you.

00:15:09.320 --> 00:15:11.110
But... who are you two?

00:15:18.840 --> 00:15:19.447
Yohoo!

00:15:19.471 --> 00:15:20.790
Woah, there you are!

00:15:22.140 --> 00:15:23.140
Eureka!

00:15:34.470 --> 00:15:35.556
Désser City?

00:15:35.580 --> 00:15:36.670
But how?

00:15:38.220 --> 00:15:39.990
Isn't this ring neat?

00:15:43.720 --> 00:15:44.830
Did Hoopa startle you?

00:15:45.030 --> 00:15:46.910
Hey, hey? Did Hoopa startle you?

00:15:47.350 --> 00:15:48.760
You did...

00:15:49.050 --> 00:15:50.050
A Pokémon?

00:15:50.090 --> 00:15:51.470
I have never seen it before.

00:15:51.750 --> 00:15:53.320
It's called Hoopa.

00:15:53.690 --> 00:15:56.570
It's also the one that left the
Matoma Berry there, as a prank.

00:15:56.760 --> 00:15:57.760
Wow.

00:15:59.180 --> 00:16:00.510
I'm sorry that it startled you.

00:16:01.130 --> 00:16:02.130
I'm Mary.

00:16:02.510 --> 00:16:03.930
I'm looking after Hoopa.

00:16:18.220 --> 00:16:20.360
Man, I sure am thirsty, though.

00:16:20.710 --> 00:16:23.500
I would like a glass of cold water.

00:16:23.800 --> 00:16:25.120
Eureka wants water too!

00:16:25.420 --> 00:16:30.300
Okay! Water! Water! Water!

00:16:39.740 --> 00:16:42.750
Water, Appear!

00:16:44.390 --> 00:16:46.596
Mass of water! Mass of water!

00:16:46.620 --> 00:16:49.550
No, no! A glass of water!

00:16:52.700 --> 00:16:54.386
Geez, Hoopa!

00:16:54.410 --> 00:16:55.980
What's with you?

00:16:57.150 --> 00:16:59.480
Well, we were able to cool off.

00:17:06.430 --> 00:17:09.370
We were thinking about
going to Désser Tower.

00:17:09.590 --> 00:17:11.180
Really? So were we.

00:17:11.550 --> 00:17:12.550
Then let's go together.

00:17:12.630 --> 00:17:13.766
Yeah! Let's go!

00:17:13.790 --> 00:17:15.886
In that case, we can get
there quicker using a ring!

00:17:15.910 --> 00:17:17.310
Oh, good idea!

00:17:19.910 --> 00:17:20.910
Hoo...!

00:17:37.210 --> 00:17:38.210
Hoopa too!

00:17:38.830 --> 00:17:40.150
Hey, wait!

00:17:46.510 --> 00:17:47.710
Hey, you alright?

00:17:48.200 --> 00:17:48.910
Geez.

00:17:49.190 --> 00:17:50.730
You're forgetting something important.

00:17:53.770 --> 00:17:55.216
Hey, what's wrong?

00:17:55.240 --> 00:17:56.590
Come over, quick!

00:18:00.060 --> 00:18:01.686
There's the brat boy over there.

00:18:01.710 --> 00:18:03.220
And I've also spotted Pikachu!

00:18:05.930 --> 00:18:06.930
Huh?

00:18:07.790 --> 00:18:08.830
That Pokémon...

00:18:09.470 --> 00:18:10.470
What is it?

00:18:11.020 --> 00:18:14.060
Hoopa can't pass through its own rings.

00:18:15.400 --> 00:18:16.400
I see.

00:18:17.690 --> 00:18:18.990
Let's walk, then!

00:18:21.820 --> 00:18:23.886
Eat this, it will cheer you up.

00:18:23.910 --> 00:18:25.590
Oh! Donuts!

00:18:27.500 --> 00:18:28.500
You like it?

00:18:28.650 --> 00:18:31.450
Like it!

00:19:11.210 --> 00:19:12.306
You found it!

00:19:12.330 --> 00:19:13.700
You found the Prison Bottle!

00:19:28.190 --> 00:19:29.190
Dearest brother...?

00:19:52.990 --> 00:19:56.200
Hoopa!

00:20:01.390 --> 00:20:02.656
It grew big!

00:20:02.680 --> 00:20:04.230
Huh? What? How?!

00:20:04.490 --> 00:20:06.166
Could it be that it evolved?

00:20:06.190 --> 00:20:07.190
No.

00:20:07.340 --> 00:20:09.740
This is Hoopa's true form.

00:20:12.650 --> 00:20:13.350
"True"...?

00:20:13.610 --> 00:20:15.160
Isn't it great, Hoopa?

00:20:15.750 --> 00:20:17.060
You returned to normal!

00:20:18.840 --> 00:20:21.230
Look at this power!

00:20:21.660 --> 00:20:23.500
Hoopa strong!

00:20:28.870 --> 00:20:29.870
Dearest brother!

00:20:30.710 --> 00:20:32.780
Mary, why are you here?

00:20:36.090 --> 00:20:38.110
Hey, something incredible just happened.

00:20:38.360 --> 00:20:40.360
We should get that bottle
rather than the Pokémon.

00:20:40.620 --> 00:20:41.800
That must be...

00:20:42.230 --> 00:20:45.610
a Pokémon-enlarging power-up device!

00:20:49.310 --> 00:20:50.306
Amazing! Amazing!

00:20:50.330 --> 00:20:51.486
A power-up device!

00:20:51.510 --> 00:20:52.860
Let's get it!

00:20:54.870 --> 00:20:56.220
The bottle? I...?

00:20:56.510 --> 00:20:58.520
Should you really have
opened it here, though?

00:20:58.920 --> 00:20:59.920
I don't know.

00:21:00.110 --> 00:21:01.110
What's going on?

00:21:02.940 --> 00:21:05.666
True power is pulsating!

00:21:05.690 --> 00:21:07.450
Hoopa incredible!

00:21:38.490 --> 00:21:39.550
It's after the bottle.

00:21:39.820 --> 00:21:40.820
What?

00:21:56.470 --> 00:21:58.330
Pikachu, Thunderbolt!

00:22:03.050 --> 00:22:04.790
This can't be!

00:22:11.500 --> 00:22:12.500
Everyone, get away!

00:22:12.910 --> 00:22:14.550
It's this bottle it wants!

00:22:15.110 --> 00:22:16.110
Dearest brother!

00:22:16.140 --> 00:22:17.210
It was still too early.

00:22:17.670 --> 00:22:18.670
Then I'll do it!

00:22:18.940 --> 00:22:20.310
This was my idea!

00:23:16.810 --> 00:23:17.430
Hey, Hoopa!

00:23:17.670 --> 00:23:18.670
Hang in there!

00:23:21.100 --> 00:23:22.100
Hoopa scared.

00:23:22.940 --> 00:23:23.940
What did you say?

00:23:28.470 --> 00:23:29.470
Don't touch it!

00:23:30.090 --> 00:23:31.750
There's something evil inside.

00:23:33.070 --> 00:23:34.780
That bottle took control of me.

00:23:35.870 --> 00:23:38.520
It's most likely also what caused
Hoopa to go on a rampage.

00:23:39.770 --> 00:23:41.850
If you touch it, you'll lose
control over your mind.

00:23:42.110 --> 00:23:43.156
No way.

00:23:43.180 --> 00:23:44.860
Heh, heh, heh, heh, heh...

00:23:45.400 --> 00:23:48.270
Now is the time for science
to open up the future!

00:23:48.510 --> 00:23:50.010
Citronic Gear, on!

00:23:51.830 --> 00:23:55.510
I call it the the
Fully-Automatic Lifting Machine!

00:23:56.630 --> 00:23:58.700
Another name that's just a description...

00:23:59.070 --> 00:24:03.210
This is an absolute masterpiece I made by
applying the Pokémon move Magnet Rise.

00:24:03.580 --> 00:24:05.910
Witness its power!

00:24:06.810 --> 00:24:07.810
Hup!

00:24:10.670 --> 00:24:12.080
Success!

00:24:12.600 --> 00:24:13.600
That's Citron for you!

00:24:13.740 --> 00:24:15.590
Technology is incredible!

00:24:18.190 --> 00:24:19.790
We've dragged you into this.

00:24:20.300 --> 00:24:21.300
I'm sorry.

00:24:21.400 --> 00:24:23.160
Don't worry about us,
but please help Hoopa.

00:24:23.590 --> 00:24:25.100
It looks exhausted.

00:24:25.400 --> 00:24:26.930
Are you okay, Hoopa?

00:24:27.720 --> 00:24:28.720
Hoopa scared.

00:24:28.890 --> 00:24:29.890
Huh?

00:24:30.140 --> 00:24:31.530
So that bottle really did...

00:24:32.010 --> 00:24:33.190
Going to disappear.

00:24:33.480 --> 00:24:34.480
Disappear?

00:24:34.910 --> 00:24:35.910
It was dark...

00:24:36.430 --> 00:24:37.510
Scary...

00:24:37.880 --> 00:24:39.570
It make Hoopa disappear.

00:24:42.890 --> 00:24:44.570
We have to let it rest.

00:24:44.780 --> 00:24:46.430
Then let's go to a Pokémon Center.

00:24:47.230 --> 00:24:48.810
The one closest to here is...

00:24:50.280 --> 00:24:51.320
across the river.

00:24:51.750 --> 00:24:52.960
Okay, let's go!

00:24:53.820 --> 00:24:54.820
But...

00:24:54.940 --> 00:24:56.410
If Hoopa rampages again...

00:24:57.050 --> 00:24:59.331
things will turn out just
like they did 100 years ago.

00:25:00.330 --> 00:25:01.330
100 years ago?

00:25:01.910 --> 00:25:03.500
Hoopa destroyed the city.

00:25:05.350 --> 00:25:06.350
100 years ago...

00:25:07.050 --> 00:25:09.850
It happened at this exact spot.

00:25:14.540 --> 00:25:17.210
Désser City used to be a small settlement.

00:25:19.710 --> 00:25:22.220
Hoopa came to the city back then.

00:25:26.430 --> 00:25:28.390
It helped itself to the townspeople's food.

00:25:28.730 --> 00:25:30.700
What are you doing? Pay up!

00:25:35.510 --> 00:25:39.020
Appear!

00:25:41.050 --> 00:25:44.600
As an apology to the angry
people, Hoopa called forth...

00:25:45.630 --> 00:25:48.430
gold and silver, treasures of all kinds.

00:25:49.110 --> 00:25:51.340
Thanks to that treasure,
the city developed.

00:25:55.310 --> 00:25:57.240
Before long, people
made a home for Hoopa...

00:25:57.750 --> 00:26:01.290
and it granted their wishes
in exchange for food offerings.

00:26:01.950 --> 00:26:02.950
Wishes?

00:26:03.130 --> 00:26:04.130
Yes.

00:26:04.650 --> 00:26:07.070
You're big and look strong!

00:26:07.660 --> 00:26:10.240
If you fought other Pokémon, would you win?

00:26:14.230 --> 00:26:15.920
Hoopa strong!

00:26:34.330 --> 00:26:35.470
Everyone was delighted.

00:26:37.310 --> 00:26:38.310
However...

00:26:40.910 --> 00:26:42.730
That caused Hoopa to escalate things.

00:26:43.640 --> 00:26:45.390
It even summoned legendary Pokémon.

00:26:46.550 --> 00:26:47.550
And finally,

00:26:48.030 --> 00:26:49.950
as it was trying to show off its power,

00:26:50.550 --> 00:26:51.550
it began to rampage.

00:27:02.330 --> 00:27:07.930
But then, our great-grandfather
sealed Hoopa's power in that bottle.

00:27:09.130 --> 00:27:10.840
That's how it turned into this form.

00:27:12.220 --> 00:27:13.220
Did that startle you?

00:27:18.700 --> 00:27:22.680
The Prison Bottle was created where
Désser Tower over there now stands.

00:27:29.130 --> 00:27:32.580
Your great-granddad must have
possessed some incredible power.

00:27:33.070 --> 00:27:34.070
Yes.

00:27:34.380 --> 00:27:36.250
Does this resemble anything to you?

00:27:39.480 --> 00:27:41.170
Huh? That shape...

00:27:41.580 --> 00:27:43.070
Satoshi, you recognize it?

00:27:43.590 --> 00:27:45.470
I think I've seen it somewhere...

00:27:46.810 --> 00:27:47.810
But that is...

00:27:48.540 --> 00:27:49.560
Let me borrow this!

00:27:50.140 --> 00:27:51.140
What? What?

00:27:53.450 --> 00:27:54.450
Here!

00:27:55.500 --> 00:27:58.440
The Creation Pokémon, the
one said to have created the world!

00:27:58.730 --> 00:27:59.730
Arceus!
Huh?

00:28:00.360 --> 00:28:01.660
A mythical Pokémon?

00:28:02.090 --> 00:28:03.090
You're right.

00:28:03.270 --> 00:28:04.690
That ring looks just like it.

00:28:04.890 --> 00:28:06.730
Oh right, it was Arceus'.

00:28:07.080 --> 00:28:08.080
Yes.

00:28:08.330 --> 00:28:10.650
Our ancestors are said to have
communicated with Arceus...

00:28:11.070 --> 00:28:12.630
and to have received powers from it.

00:28:13.910 --> 00:28:14.910
Our great-grandfather...

00:28:15.500 --> 00:28:17.260
had mastered these powers.

00:28:18.650 --> 00:28:20.220
What about you and Mary-san?

00:28:20.760 --> 00:28:23.110
Unfortunately, we
still aren't at that level.

00:28:23.660 --> 00:28:25.000
We're still in training.

00:28:26.330 --> 00:28:31.820
After sealing the bottle, along with Hoopa's power, our
great-grandfather took Hoopa back to his birthplace.

00:28:32.860 --> 00:28:35.236
That was the place where the
two of us were born and grew up:

00:28:35.260 --> 00:28:36.280
Arkhe Valley.

00:28:38.110 --> 00:28:39.800
You will live here.

00:28:40.230 --> 00:28:41.420
No want to!

00:28:46.430 --> 00:28:47.910
How many times do I have to tell you?

00:28:48.360 --> 00:28:51.800
Even though you can use them to call things
forth, you're unable to pass through them.

00:28:53.500 --> 00:28:56.620
Give power back! Give
back! Give back! Give ba-

00:29:01.310 --> 00:29:03.510
Until you understand the
meaning of your confinement...

00:29:04.330 --> 00:29:06.950
you can't pass
through the rings yourself.

00:29:08.120 --> 00:29:10.880
Give power back!

00:29:12.810 --> 00:29:15.240
The world does not belong to you alone.

00:29:16.230 --> 00:29:18.750
The world you see through the
rings is not everything there is.

00:29:21.580 --> 00:29:26.440
To Hoopa, the life it was made to live to understand
its confinement was nothing but perplexing.

00:29:59.870 --> 00:30:00.260
But...

00:30:00.790 --> 00:30:04.810
When we were born, Hoopa
got someone that it could relate to.

00:30:15.690 --> 00:30:16.690
Here.

00:30:29.370 --> 00:30:32.630
We spent our days as if
the three of us were siblings.

00:30:40.170 --> 00:30:42.170
The two of us did a lot
of reckless things, too...

00:30:42.310 --> 00:30:45.310
Wanting to see what lied outside
Arkhe Valley, we went into the mountains.

00:30:46.330 --> 00:30:47.730
But we got lost.

00:30:54.440 --> 00:30:55.440
Hoopa.

00:31:04.750 --> 00:31:05.750
Dearest brother!

00:31:05.870 --> 00:31:06.910
I've been looking for you!

00:31:07.070 --> 00:31:08.230
Once again you two have...!

00:31:08.570 --> 00:31:09.590
Please, dearest brother!

00:31:10.010 --> 00:31:11.010
Hoopa's...
Huh?

00:31:13.370 --> 00:31:14.370
That's quite a fever!

00:31:15.550 --> 00:31:17.686
Hoopa... cold...

00:31:17.710 --> 00:31:18.930
We'll cure you right now!

00:31:19.830 --> 00:31:20.830
Disappear...

00:31:21.400 --> 00:31:23.350
Hoopa disappear.

00:31:23.610 --> 00:31:24.970
Of course you won't!

00:31:25.480 --> 00:31:27.390
It keeps talking like this!

00:31:31.430 --> 00:31:34.070
This is the moment when
we need to use our powers!

00:31:34.390 --> 00:31:35.390
Huh?

00:31:35.500 --> 00:31:36.630
We'll make it some medicine.

00:31:38.630 --> 00:31:39.630
Yeah.

00:32:03.550 --> 00:32:04.780
Hungry.

00:32:05.430 --> 00:32:06.430
Huh?

00:32:06.470 --> 00:32:08.250
Hungry!

00:32:09.630 --> 00:32:10.630
Hoopa!

00:32:10.670 --> 00:32:11.690
You got better?!

00:32:11.960 --> 00:32:14.220
Yeah, better! Look!

00:32:17.670 --> 00:32:20.030
Geez, you get carried away too easily...

00:32:21.640 --> 00:32:23.030
The medicine worked.

00:32:23.290 --> 00:32:24.290
Yeah.

00:32:24.360 --> 00:32:25.880
Hoopa, you did really good, too.

00:32:26.300 --> 00:32:27.420
Hoopa great?

00:32:27.670 --> 00:32:28.670
Yeah, you're great.

00:32:28.970 --> 00:32:29.970
We're all great!

00:32:30.220 --> 00:32:33.500
Yay! Great! Great! Great! Great!

00:32:34.510 --> 00:32:35.510
Geez.

00:32:49.790 --> 00:32:50.890
Great-grandpa!

00:32:56.170 --> 00:32:57.170
Welcome back.

00:32:57.370 --> 00:32:59.370
We've all worked really hard.

00:32:59.870 --> 00:33:03.030
Yes. Good job getting back safely.

00:33:10.350 --> 00:33:11.350
Thank you.

00:33:12.310 --> 00:33:14.540
Thank you? Why? What?

00:33:16.200 --> 00:33:17.200
Because you...

00:33:17.950 --> 00:33:19.270
are family too.

00:33:20.390 --> 00:33:21.390
Huh?

00:33:29.930 --> 00:33:32.680
Everyone nice. Love everyone.

00:33:33.100 --> 00:33:39.340
Even though our great-grandfather's not around, I thought
it would be all right if Hoopa got its original power back.

00:33:39.900 --> 00:33:43.240
So I left on a journey
to find the Prison Bottle.

00:33:44.510 --> 00:33:45.510
But...

00:33:45.660 --> 00:33:46.660
This happened.

00:33:48.200 --> 00:33:49.690
I apologize to all of you.

00:33:50.170 --> 00:33:52.770
However, in one way or another,
I want to do something for Hoopa.

00:33:55.790 --> 00:33:57.260
What will you do with the bottle?

00:33:57.740 --> 00:33:59.500
I'll take it back to
Arkhe Valley like this.

00:34:00.310 --> 00:34:01.610
No! Scary!

00:34:02.040 --> 00:34:04.230
Bottle make Hoopa disappear!

00:34:04.630 --> 00:34:07.720
That's why I'll look into why that happens.

00:34:08.460 --> 00:34:11.850
If we don't understand the
cause, you can't return to normal.

00:34:12.190 --> 00:34:14.110
Then Hoopa not return!

00:34:21.320 --> 00:34:22.320
The Rocket Gang!

00:34:23.210 --> 00:34:24.626
We'll take this!

00:34:24.650 --> 00:34:26.490
This is one amazing bottle!

00:34:26.790 --> 00:34:27.820
No! Don't touch it!

00:34:28.540 --> 00:34:30.790
But I already did!

00:34:32.250 --> 00:34:32.600
Huh?

00:34:32.950 --> 00:34:36.490
But if you hand over Pikachu, we
just might return the bottle to you.

00:34:36.700 --> 00:34:38.290
You're being too nice.

00:34:38.830 --> 00:34:41.686
What are you saying? Once Pikachu
gets here, we'll just withdraw right away.

00:34:41.710 --> 00:34:43.956
Getting both of them feels good.

00:34:43.980 --> 00:34:46.300
Wow! It feels good and wicked.

00:34:47.290 --> 00:34:48.290
Nyarth?

00:35:03.670 --> 00:35:03.980
Wha-

00:35:04.630 --> 00:35:05.630
Huh?

00:35:05.980 --> 00:35:06.980
What?

00:35:07.020 --> 00:35:09.740
No! No! No! Hoopa no wanna disappear!

00:35:10.090 --> 00:35:11.550
Hoopa, don't give in!

00:35:12.630 --> 00:35:13.630
Hoopa!

00:35:16.710 --> 00:35:17.710
Begone!

00:35:33.130 --> 00:35:36.110
The power's trying to take over Hoopa.

00:35:36.550 --> 00:35:37.550
The power?

00:35:37.630 --> 00:35:41.800
But that power is Hoopa's original power
that got sealed 100 years ago, is it not?

00:35:42.280 --> 00:35:42.760
Yeah!

00:35:43.190 --> 00:35:45.940
It is! But nevertheless, it's definitely...

00:35:46.650 --> 00:35:48.740
Hoopa, you can do it! You mustn't give in!

00:35:55.800 --> 00:35:57.550
That's it! Drive it out, Hoopa!

00:36:20.510 --> 00:36:21.510
You all right?

00:36:22.350 --> 00:36:24.860
Saton... Hoopa won.

00:36:28.810 --> 00:36:29.810
Where's the bottle?

00:36:31.030 --> 00:36:32.030
Here.

00:36:57.510 --> 00:36:58.510
That's...

00:36:58.710 --> 00:36:59.710
Rage, huh?
Rage?

00:37:00.870 --> 00:37:03.190
The true color of the
desire to consume Hoopa:

00:37:03.740 --> 00:37:07.270
Rage towards having been
sealed away for 100 years.

00:37:07.720 --> 00:37:10.950
So the rage is trying to
consume the real Hoopa?

00:37:11.450 --> 00:37:13.410
Even though it originally
was Hoopa's power?

00:37:13.820 --> 00:37:16.330
It's trying to take the real one's place.

00:37:16.910 --> 00:37:18.430
It's Hoopa, but it also isn't Hoopa.

00:37:19.080 --> 00:37:20.460
That's Hoopa's shadow.

00:37:22.630 --> 00:37:24.440
The mood's taken a turn.

00:37:24.750 --> 00:37:25.750
Shall we get it?

00:37:36.410 --> 00:37:37.410
The Rocket Gang!

00:37:44.840 --> 00:37:46.150
Hoopa!

00:37:46.790 --> 00:37:47.830
Does it want to rampage...

00:37:48.300 --> 00:37:49.820
just like 100 years ago?

00:37:55.450 --> 00:37:56.740
Disappear!

00:37:56.990 --> 00:37:58.830
No! Hoopa no disappear!

00:38:02.220 --> 00:38:03.220
Go, Warrgle!

00:38:07.830 --> 00:38:08.830
Air Slash!

00:38:24.390 --> 00:38:25.390
Hoopa!

00:38:26.070 --> 00:38:28.950
Appear!

00:38:40.120 --> 00:38:41.120
Lugia?!

00:38:41.510 --> 00:38:42.510
Wow!

00:38:42.700 --> 00:38:43.700
That's...

00:38:45.400 --> 00:38:48.170
Hoopa call strong one, beat shadow!

00:38:49.450 --> 00:38:51.430
Lugia, help us out!

00:39:07.190 --> 00:39:08.306
Everyone, now's our chance!

00:39:08.330 --> 00:39:08.787
Yeah.

00:39:08.811 --> 00:39:10.070
Lugia, we'll leave it to you!

00:39:23.910 --> 00:39:24.910
Dearest brother...

00:39:26.140 --> 00:39:27.140
The bottle has...

00:39:27.290 --> 00:39:28.290
Yeah.

00:39:32.590 --> 00:39:37.130
Having been rejected by Hoopa, the shadow had
nowhere to go, so it destroyed the bottle.

00:39:43.160 --> 00:39:45.890
Let's create a Prison Bottle again.

00:39:46.350 --> 00:39:47.426
Create one?

00:39:47.450 --> 00:39:48.510
You can do that?

00:39:48.840 --> 00:39:49.310
Yes.

00:39:49.790 --> 00:39:52.646
As long as we have these, we can
recreate the bottle at the Désser Tower.

00:39:52.670 --> 00:39:53.670
Really?

00:39:53.880 --> 00:39:56.650
The Désser Tower is where
the Prison Bottle was made.

00:39:57.270 --> 00:39:58.810
Even now, there's power remaining.

00:39:59.400 --> 00:40:06.110
Our great-grandfather used earth, fire and water,
three powers abundant in nature, to make the bottle.

00:40:06.920 --> 00:40:10.090
So all we have to do is
find a Pokémon of each type,

00:40:10.630 --> 00:40:13.840
and we should be able to
recreate the Prison Bottle as well.

00:40:14.520 --> 00:40:16.650
I have a Gekogashira that
can be the power of water.

00:40:17.100 --> 00:40:19.130
The power of fire could be my Tairenar.

00:40:19.480 --> 00:40:23.960
But none of our partners are Ground
types that can be the power of earth...

00:40:24.510 --> 00:40:26.550
Oh! There was a good little one!

00:40:32.790 --> 00:40:35.030
Appear!

00:40:39.050 --> 00:40:40.510
There it is, a Hippopotas!

00:40:41.880 --> 00:40:44.590
Please, Hippopotas!
We'd like you to help us out!

00:40:50.030 --> 00:40:51.030
It found us!

00:41:05.080 --> 00:41:08.540
Let us go... to Désser Tower... already...

00:41:08.840 --> 00:41:10.180
Let's use a ring, then!

00:41:10.490 --> 00:41:12.100
But Hoopa...

00:41:12.730 --> 00:41:13.730
Oh right...

00:41:16.650 --> 00:41:17.650
Hoopa...

00:41:17.830 --> 00:41:18.830
Huh?

00:41:18.990 --> 00:41:23.340
Until we complete the bottle, you have
to go hide so your shadow can't find you.

00:41:25.510 --> 00:41:27.000
Hoopa hide!

00:41:28.190 --> 00:41:29.560
I'll stay with it!

00:41:30.760 --> 00:41:32.370
We can't leave Hoopa alone!

00:41:33.180 --> 00:41:34.650
We'll guard you to the bitter end!

00:41:36.310 --> 00:41:38.710
Saton... Pikan...

00:41:41.900 --> 00:41:43.190
Come out, Gekogashira!

00:41:48.550 --> 00:41:50.730
Citron, you take care of Gekogashira.

00:41:51.160 --> 00:41:52.160
Understood.

00:41:52.300 --> 00:41:54.736
Satoshi-kun, please take care of Hoopa.

00:41:54.760 --> 00:41:56.940
Hoopa protect Saton!

00:41:57.420 --> 00:41:58.490
That's rich.

00:42:13.800 --> 00:42:15.710
Satoshi, don't do anything reckless.

00:42:16.090 --> 00:42:17.090
I won't.

00:42:23.390 --> 00:42:24.390
Let's go.

00:42:29.530 --> 00:42:32.190
Both you and the shadow are Hoopa, right?

00:42:32.430 --> 00:42:33.020
Huh?

00:42:33.190 --> 00:42:37.640
I was just thinking... It's weird how it
seems like yourself and yourself are fighting.

00:42:39.580 --> 00:42:42.900
If both are you, I'd like you to get along.

00:42:43.290 --> 00:42:44.830
Get along?

00:43:20.920 --> 00:43:22.270
Solrock, Flash.

00:43:49.750 --> 00:43:50.750
Saton...

00:43:51.050 --> 00:43:51.300
Huh?

00:43:51.720 --> 00:43:54.270
Hoopa and shadow can get along?

00:43:54.810 --> 00:43:55.810
You can.

00:43:56.220 --> 00:43:58.730
And if you do, won't you
get your original power back?

00:44:00.360 --> 00:44:01.360
Really?

00:44:04.070 --> 00:44:07.800
If power come back,
Hoopa grant Saton's wish!

00:44:08.250 --> 00:44:09.790
I know exactly what my wish is:

00:44:10.140 --> 00:44:11.180
Pokémon Master!

00:44:11.500 --> 00:44:13.026
That Appear!

00:44:13.050 --> 00:44:14.066
That's not possible.

00:44:14.090 --> 00:44:15.090
Huh?

00:44:16.220 --> 00:44:18.970
A Pokémon Master isn't something
you can get from somewhere,

00:44:19.480 --> 00:44:21.050
it's something you become yourself!

00:44:22.830 --> 00:44:24.090
You work hard for it yourself!

00:44:24.300 --> 00:44:25.950
Can't use ring?

00:45:36.460 --> 00:45:37.550
Thanks, Lugia!

00:46:24.920 --> 00:46:25.920
Lugia?

00:46:31.990 --> 00:46:33.910
Hoopa, we'll fight too!

00:46:34.360 --> 00:46:35.820
Hoopa fight!

00:46:36.250 --> 00:46:38.470
Then bring out some extremely fast Pokémon!

00:46:38.790 --> 00:46:40.100
Then...

00:46:44.390 --> 00:46:46.700
Appear!

00:46:59.630 --> 00:47:00.630
Latias!

00:47:01.210 --> 00:47:02.210
Latios!

00:47:02.790 --> 00:47:03.790
Rayquaza!

00:47:04.280 --> 00:47:05.476
Did Hoopa startle you?

00:47:05.500 --> 00:47:07.070
Yeah, you startled me!

00:47:09.180 --> 00:47:11.370
Rayquaza, Latias, Latios!

00:47:11.870 --> 00:47:13.100
Please lend us your power!

00:47:22.380 --> 00:47:23.380
Let's go!

00:47:30.380 --> 00:47:31.420
Dragon Pulse!

00:47:41.050 --> 00:47:42.280
This way, over here!

00:48:00.510 --> 00:48:01.510
What?!

00:48:19.590 --> 00:48:22.270
Latias, Latios! Psychic!

00:49:33.910 --> 00:49:36.110
Legendary... Pokémon?

00:49:40.550 --> 00:49:41.960
A whole ton of...

00:49:42.300 --> 00:49:43.300
legendary Pokémon!

00:49:43.640 --> 00:49:45.210
It's a legendary festival!

00:49:48.330 --> 00:49:50.860
It copy my Appear!

00:49:51.190 --> 00:49:53.080
These are worthy opponents!

00:49:57.000 --> 00:49:58.680
Barza-san, please hurry.

00:50:03.320 --> 00:50:04.320
O Time...

00:50:04.540 --> 00:50:05.540
O Skies...

00:50:06.070 --> 00:50:07.980
O Vast creation...

00:50:14.950 --> 00:50:16.030
Everyone, now!

00:50:16.970 --> 00:50:17.970
Right!

00:50:18.200 --> 00:50:19.200
It's time!

00:50:19.670 --> 00:50:20.670
Let us begin!

00:50:21.020 --> 00:50:22.150
Water Pulse!

00:50:23.740 --> 00:50:25.350
Tairenar, Flamethrower!

00:50:26.270 --> 00:50:27.870
Hippopotas, Sand Attack!

00:50:56.460 --> 00:50:57.460
Dragon Pulse!

00:50:58.090 --> 00:50:59.670
Pikachu, Thunderbolt!

00:51:24.910 --> 00:51:25.910
Mega Evolution!

00:51:26.110 --> 00:51:27.290
Hoopa startled!

00:52:21.960 --> 00:52:22.960
Dodge!

00:52:57.950 --> 00:52:58.950
Here it comes!

00:53:00.840 --> 00:53:02.120
Please take care of it, Sonansu!

00:53:30.460 --> 00:53:31.460
Saton!

00:53:39.350 --> 00:53:40.950
You saved me! Thanks!

00:53:42.860 --> 00:53:43.860
Saton startled?

00:53:48.060 --> 00:53:49.060
Rayquaza!

00:54:12.070 --> 00:54:13.470
They're running pretty wild!

00:54:14.300 --> 00:54:15.930
Let's not get involved in that.

00:54:16.230 --> 00:54:17.720
Anyway, let's run!

00:54:30.860 --> 00:54:32.300
O Prison Bottle!

00:54:32.730 --> 00:54:33.730
Come forth!

00:54:45.470 --> 00:54:46.470
Go up!

00:56:01.320 --> 00:56:02.320
Oh no you don't!

00:56:06.280 --> 00:56:07.290
Dragon Pulse!

00:56:11.900 --> 00:56:12.900
It noticed us.
What?

00:56:43.000 --> 00:56:44.000
Rayquaza!

00:56:44.140 --> 00:56:46.710
Twister! Whip up a Twister!

00:57:17.020 --> 00:57:20.010
Latias, Latios! Psychic!

00:57:25.100 --> 00:57:26.390
All right, that's it!

00:57:27.500 --> 00:57:29.190
Everyone do good!

00:58:34.490 --> 00:58:35.490
They broke it!

01:00:55.980 --> 01:00:56.980
Saton.

01:00:57.830 --> 01:00:59.530
Calm down, shadow!

01:01:12.110 --> 01:01:13.800
Disappear.

01:01:14.410 --> 01:01:15.410
Saton!

01:01:15.670 --> 01:01:17.230
The sealed power spoke!

01:01:17.470 --> 01:01:19.350
It possessed him.

01:01:19.800 --> 01:01:21.960
You shall disappear.

01:01:22.780 --> 01:01:25.150
I am Hoopa.

01:01:25.820 --> 01:01:27.780
I'm the one who'll remain.

01:01:32.790 --> 01:01:35.370
Hoopa want save shadow! It what Saton said!

01:01:35.530 --> 01:01:36.530
Disappear!

01:01:37.030 --> 01:01:40.460
Explain about Hoopa! No be mad, listen!

01:01:43.350 --> 01:01:46.520
Everyone waiting!
Waiting for turn to normal!

01:02:03.710 --> 01:02:04.710
Here.

01:02:29.550 --> 01:02:31.270
Hey, hey, did Hoopa startle you?

01:02:31.510 --> 01:02:33.420
Shadow also have fun from now on!

01:02:42.440 --> 01:02:44.990
Hoopa waited for shadow!

01:03:20.440 --> 01:03:21.440
Satoshi!

01:03:24.670 --> 01:03:26.510
I heard your voice.

01:03:27.350 --> 01:03:29.180
I'm sure it got through
to your shadow, too.

01:03:32.940 --> 01:03:34.350
The evil power has disappeared.

01:03:35.260 --> 01:03:36.780
Thank you, Satoshi-kun!

01:03:54.890 --> 01:03:55.890
What did they say?

01:03:58.470 --> 01:04:00.520
They say they all startled!

01:04:17.430 --> 01:04:19.750
They were all summoned
here by Hoopa and the shadow?

01:04:20.010 --> 01:04:21.270
I got startled.

01:04:30.110 --> 01:04:31.370
Are we safe?

01:04:31.750 --> 01:04:32.750
Probably...

01:04:32.830 --> 01:04:34.170
Then, let's do the usual:

01:04:34.650 --> 01:04:36.590
Somehow, this feels...

01:04:53.880 --> 01:04:55.216
I'm scared!

01:04:55.240 --> 01:04:56.240
What's going on?

01:04:56.380 --> 01:04:57.500
Space is getting distorted!

01:04:57.880 --> 01:04:58.880
Huh?

01:04:59.260 --> 01:05:02.500
It might be a repercussion of the legendary
Pokémon being forcibly summoned here.

01:05:10.170 --> 01:05:11.820
Pikachu, Thunderbolt!

01:05:37.980 --> 01:05:39.006
We can't get out?

01:05:39.030 --> 01:05:40.030
What do we do?

01:05:40.170 --> 01:05:41.170
At this rate...

01:05:43.690 --> 01:05:45.450
Saton, use this.

01:05:45.790 --> 01:05:46.790
Huh?

01:05:47.610 --> 01:05:48.610
That's right!

01:05:58.680 --> 01:05:59.870
Here we go, Hoopa!

01:06:12.010 --> 01:06:13.910
True Hoopa...

01:06:14.680 --> 01:06:17.886
Appear!

01:06:17.910 --> 01:06:18.910
Hoopa!

01:06:22.460 --> 01:06:27.340
Here goes! The true, true Hoopa's power!

01:06:50.430 --> 01:06:51.590
You go on ahead.

01:07:17.750 --> 01:07:19.040
You're the only ones left.

01:07:20.730 --> 01:07:21.730
The ring!

01:07:21.960 --> 01:07:23.400
Everyone, get out of here right now!

01:07:23.710 --> 01:07:24.120
But...

01:07:24.510 --> 01:07:26.570
Hoopa can't pass through the rings.

01:07:28.710 --> 01:07:29.710
That...

01:07:30.010 --> 01:07:31.510
we won't know unless we try!

01:07:33.390 --> 01:07:34.390
Saton.

01:07:40.700 --> 01:07:43.990
Hoopa! My wish is to
leave this place with you!

01:08:14.140 --> 01:08:16.170
This is our wish, too!

01:08:16.510 --> 01:08:17.510
Yeah!
Satoshi-kun!

01:08:18.140 --> 01:08:19.340
Hoopa, let's go!

01:08:19.530 --> 01:08:20.530
Yeah!

01:08:29.050 --> 01:08:30.050
I'll help!

01:08:30.110 --> 01:08:31.110
Right!

01:08:59.050 --> 01:09:00.050
Dearest brother!

01:09:00.170 --> 01:09:01.980
The distortion has... stopped.

01:09:02.330 --> 01:09:02.680
Huh?

01:09:03.180 --> 01:09:04.180
It might be...

01:09:10.460 --> 01:09:13.160
Hoopa, I'll take you back to Arkhe Valley.

01:09:13.530 --> 01:09:14.530
I swear it!

01:09:18.670 --> 01:09:20.940
Believe in yourself, Hoopa!

01:09:21.500 --> 01:09:22.970
Mary, use your power!

01:09:23.270 --> 01:09:24.630
I'll use mine from the other side!

01:09:25.800 --> 01:09:26.880
Begone!

01:09:31.270 --> 01:09:32.360
Do all you can!

01:09:36.270 --> 01:09:39.560
Break out of your confinement!

01:09:43.980 --> 01:09:46.180
Until you understand the
meaning of your confinement...

01:09:46.940 --> 01:09:49.550
you can't pass
through the rings yourself.

01:09:57.390 --> 01:09:58.390
Thank you.

01:09:59.260 --> 01:10:01.350
Thank you? Why? What?

01:10:03.340 --> 01:10:04.340
Because you...

01:10:05.100 --> 01:10:06.440
are family too.

01:10:07.560 --> 01:10:08.560
Huh?

01:10:18.220 --> 01:10:19.670
Hoopa no disappear!

01:10:19.980 --> 01:10:24.760
Be with everyone!

01:10:37.150 --> 01:10:41.470
Barza, Appear!

01:10:50.570 --> 01:10:51.570
You did it!

01:10:52.300 --> 01:10:53.660
The confinement has been broken!

01:11:44.990 --> 01:11:45.990
Arceus.

01:12:16.890 --> 01:12:19.070
Bye and so long, legendaries.

01:12:19.470 --> 01:12:20.970
Now we can say it, right?

01:12:21.480 --> 01:12:22.357
Somehow,

01:12:22.381 --> 01:12:23.420
this feels...

01:12:25.050 --> 01:12:26.050
Oh dear...

01:12:40.470 --> 01:12:42.220
Appear!

01:12:47.550 --> 01:12:49.630
Our wish has finally come true.

01:12:50.060 --> 01:12:51.060
Yes.

01:12:53.130 --> 01:12:55.850
I wonder if Great-Grandfather
would have been pleased.

01:12:56.510 --> 01:12:59.680
You can even use the rings
to return to Arkhe Valley.

01:13:01.670 --> 01:13:03.370
Hoopa not return yet.

01:13:05.150 --> 01:13:06.950
Hoopa fix this place!

01:13:07.670 --> 01:13:08.670
You will?

01:13:10.150 --> 01:13:11.190
Leave it to Hoopa!

01:13:12.920 --> 01:13:15.420
Saton, do best, make dream come true!

01:13:15.690 --> 01:13:15.990
Huh?

01:13:16.350 --> 01:13:17.830
Aim to be Ponster!

01:13:18.280 --> 01:13:19.280
"Ponster"?

01:13:22.150 --> 01:13:23.900
You mean "Aim to be a Pokémon Master"!

01:13:25.310 --> 01:13:26.310
That right!

01:13:26.600 --> 01:13:32.250
Ponster! Ponster! Ponster! Ponster!
